<rml>
<head>
	<!-- The special inventory (uiextrainventory.py ExtraInventoryWindow,
	     uiscript extrainventorywindow.py; wave 4b, NOVA-16). While the
	     extra-inventory flag is on, the Interface makes
	     nui_extra_inventory.ExtraInventoryWindow (controller
	     assets/root/nui_extra_inventory.py), a subclass of the legacy class
	     whose widgets are proxies: the categories and pages, every pick,
	     move, use, transfer, split, sell, link, the Alt + right-click
	     multi-open of a stack of chests and its count dialog, the marks
	     and locks of the trade windows, are legacy's code, and this
	     document shows what legacy's refresh tells the proxies. The five
	     category tabs (categories: their locale keys, in the server's
	     order: scrolls, materials, stones, chests, costumes) and the page
	     tabs of the shown category (pages: I to V, I to XII for the
	     costumes), the page shown as a lean slot grid of
	     EXTRA_INVENTORY_PAGE_SIZE cells (5 x 9) with the trade marks
	     (is-in-use, is-unusable-ontop and their wash); every count comes
	     from the limits module. Cell events reach the legacy handlers
	     through nui_slots.LegacySlotEvents (pick and place through the
	     legacy mouse controller). The board is kept, hidden, after its
	     first open (nui_hud.KeptBoard): its cells and tabs go while it hides
	     (cells_on, tabs_on). The body and its controls take no focus, so
	     controls act on a left mousedown; the wheel over the board turns
	     the page, as legacy's OnScrollWheel. It draws below the legacy UI
	     layer (nui-below-legacy-ui), as legacy's window lived in it. A left
	     or right press anywhere on it raises the window (board_press). -->
	<title>extra-inventory</title>
	<link type="text/template" href="../../nui.rtpl"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="extra-inventory.rcss"/>
</head>
<body template="nui" id="extra-inventory" class="nui-window nui-fx nui-anim nui-below-legacy-ui xinv" data-model="extra_inventory"
      data-event-mousedown="board_press(ev.button)" data-event-mousescroll="wheel(ev.wheel_delta_y)"
      data-class-xinv--pages-many="size(pages) > 7">
	<div class="nui-window__titlebar xinv__titlebar">
		<handle id="xinv-title" class="nui-window__handle xinv__handle" move_target="#document">
			<span class="nui-window__title xinv__title">@ui.KEYCHANGE_EXTRA_INVENTORY</span>
		</handle>
		<button id="xinv-close" class="nui-button nui-button--ghost nui-button--icon nui-window__close nui-anim xinv__close"
		        data-event-mousedown="close_press(ev.button)"><span class="nui-glyph nui-glyph--close"><span
			class="nui-glyph__a"></span><span class="nui-glyph__b"></span></span></button>
	</div>
	<div class="nui-window__body xinv__body">
		<div class="xinv__main">
			<!-- The page tabs of the shown category (legacy shows the first
			     GetPageCount of its twelve), the page shown raised. -->
			<div id="xinv-pages" class="xinv-pages" data-for="g : tabs_on">
				<button class="nui-button nui-anim xinv-page" data-for="p : pages" data-attr-id="'xinv-page-' + it_index"
				        data-class-is-selected="it_index == page" data-event-mousedown="page_press(it_index, ev.button)"><span
					class="xinv-page__label">{{ p.label }}</span></button>
			</div>
			<div id="xinv-grid" class="nui-slot-grid nui-slot-grid--lean xinv-grid" data-for="g : cells_on"
			     data-class-is-attaching="attaching" data-class-nui-attach-right="attach_right"
			     data-class-nui-slot-grid--cols-5="cols == 5">
				<div class="nui-slot nui-anim nui-fx" data-for="c : cells" data-attr-id="'xinv-cell-' + it_index"
				     data-class-is-empty="c.kind == '' &amp;&amp; !c.covered" data-class-is-covered="c.covered"
				     data-class-is-picked="c.picked" data-class-is-active="c.active"
				     data-class-is-glow-red="c.glow == 'red'" data-class-is-glow-blue="c.glow == 'blue'" data-class-is-glow-yellow="c.glow == 'yellow'" data-class-is-glow-cyan="c.glow == 'cyan'" data-class-is-glow-violet="c.glow == 'violet'"
				     data-class-is-target="c.target == 'move'" data-class-is-blocked="c.target == 'blocked'"
				     data-class-is-usable="c.target == 'usable'" data-class-is-unusable="c.target == 'unusable'"
				     data-class-nui-slot--h2="c.h == 2" data-class-nui-slot--h3="c.h == 3"
				     data-class-is-in-use="c.in_use" data-class-is-unusable-ontop="c.unusable_ontop" data-class-is-sell-marked="c.sell"
				     data-event-mousedown="cell_press(it_index, ev.button)" data-event-mouseup="cell_release(it_index, ev.button)"
				     data-event-dblclick="cell_use(it_index)" data-event-mouseover="cell_over(it_index)"
				     data-event-mouseout="cell_out(it_index)" data-event-nuidrop="cell_drop(it_index)">
					<img class="nui-slot__icon" data-if="c.icon != ''" data-attr-src="c.icon"/>
					<div class="nui-slot__wash" data-if="c.in_use || c.unusable_ontop"></div>
					<nui-number class="nui-slot__number" data-if="c.count != ''" data-attr-value="c.count"/>
					<nui-frames class="nui-slot__active" data-if="c.active" count="13" delay="0.0667"/>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<!-- The five categories, the one shown raised. -->
		<div id="xinv-cats" class="xinv-cats" data-for="g : tabs_on">
			<button class="nui-button nui-anim xinv-cat" data-for="k : categories" data-attr-id="'xinv-cat-' + it_index"
			        data-class-is-selected="it_index == category" data-event-mousedown="category_press(it_index, ev.button)"><span
				class="xinv-cat__label">{{ k.label }}</span></button>
		</div>
	</div>
</body>
</rml>
